{"id":"n65251-1-7","stage":3,"title":"슬리퍼 · 拖鞋","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65251-1-7-1","ko":"슬리퍼 바람인데 이대로 밖에 나가도 될까?","zh":"我现在只穿了拖鞋，这样直接出门可以吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"슬리퍼","meaning":"拖鞋","explanation":"슬리퍼：拖鞋","readings":[{"term":"슬리퍼","audio":"/audio/760f996876ab65918a7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65251","senseId":"1","lemma":"슬리퍼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람인데","meaning":"表示那种穿着。","explanation":"바람：表示那种穿着。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58172","senseId":"2","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이대로","meaning":"就这样，照旧","explanation":"이대로：就这样，照旧","readings":[{"term":"이대로","audio":"/audio/e17181d52df9a2ddf217.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24844","senseId":"1","lemma":"이대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。","explanation":"밖：表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"5","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가도","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될까?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"760f996876ab6591","term":"슬리퍼","zh":"拖鞋","audio":"/audio/760f996876ab65918a7b.mp3","entryId":"65251","definition":"没有到脚后跟部分，只脚尖处穿上的鞋子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"表示那种穿着。","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"58172","definition":"表示那种穿着。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"e17181d52df9a2dd","term":"이대로","zh":"就这样，照旧","audio":"/audio/e17181d52df9a2ddf217.mp3","entryId":"24844","definition":"跟原来的样子或状态一样，没有变化。","pronunciation":["이대로"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c158b30587a884a8cf25.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65251-1-7-2","ko":"가까운 동네 슈퍼마켓에 가는데 뭐 어때.","zh":"我就去附近的超市，没问题的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가까운","meaning":"近","explanation":"가깝다：近；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가깝다","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65200","senseId":"1","lemma":"가깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동네","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"슈퍼마켓에","meaning":"超市","explanation":"슈퍼마켓：超市；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"슈퍼마켓","audio":"/audio/cc8a26781ea2664e3905.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62509","senseId":"1","lemma":"슈퍼마켓","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는데","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때.","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ff63e71387c2c60","term":"가깝다","zh":"近","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3","entryId":"65200","definition":"离某个地方不远。","pronunciation":["가깝따"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"cc8a26781ea2664e","term":"슈퍼마켓","zh":"超市","audio":"/audio/cc8a26781ea2664e3905.mp3","entryId":"62509","definition":"销售各种食物和生活必需品等的大型商店。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0fd8062bf757b7f0a7d4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.817,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65251","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我就去附近的超市，没问题的。","我现在只穿了拖鞋，这样直接出门可以吗？","有没有不用减少食量也能减肥的方法呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我现在只穿了拖鞋，这样直接出门可以吗？","有没有不用减少食量也能减肥的方法呢？","我就去附近的超市，没问题的。"],"answe